     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par10/separator_copy_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Nachmittag</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_11"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par11/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_riverwalk_shutterstock2046416633_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Blick auf die Skyline von Chicago vom Riverwalk"
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par11/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Entspannen am Riverwalk</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_12"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Der Riverwalk führt mitten in der Stadt am Chicago River entlang zum Lake Michigan</li><li>Hier lege ich mich gern auf eine der Liegen, beobachte die Kajaks und Elektroboote und blicke zur Skyline empor. Urlaubsfeeling pur!</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_13"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Ohio Street Beach</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_14"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Eine Besonderheit an Chicago ist, dass es hier Strände mitten in der Stadt gibt</li><li>Mein Tipp: Ich liege gern am Ohio Street Beach und esse ein Eis von The Original Rainbow Cone oder gehe mit Blick auf Chicagos Wolkenkratzer schwimmen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_15"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "600 North Jean-Baptiste Pointe DuSable Lake Shore Drive",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_16"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Museum of Science</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_17"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Im Museum of Science and Industry bin ich schon durch das Modell von einem menschlichen Herz gegangen und habe alles über die Entstehung des Telefons gelernt. Ein wunderbar anschauliches Museum!</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_18"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "5700 S DuSable Lake Shore Dr",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_19"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Abend</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_20"
     },
     {
      "type": "image",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par20/image_copy",
      "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-chicago/lh_app_chicago_millers-pub_shutterstock_2576464647_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
      "contentDescription": "Eingang zum traditionsreichen Miller’s Pub in Chicago mit leuchtendem Neonschild am Abend."
     },
     {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "id": "/content/mobile/lh/de/articles/a-perfect-day-in-chicago/jcr:content/articlecontentfragment/par20/separator_copy"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Dinner im Miller’s Pub</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_21"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Meine Empfehlung: Spareribs bestellen. Im Miller’s Pub gibt’s die besten in ganz Chicago</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_22"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "134 S Wabash Ave",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_23"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Ale House</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_24"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<ul><li>Immer wenn ich im über 100 Jahre alten Pub Ale House am Tresen sitze, komme ich mit jemandem ins Gespräch</li><li>Die Menschen sind hier wunderbar gesellig und aufgeschlossen</li></ul>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_25"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "219 West North Avenue (at Wieland)",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_26"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Bildrechte: Unsplash, Alamy, Getty Images, Shutterstock",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_27"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "<b>Zur Person</b>",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_28"
     },
     {
      "type": "copyText",
      "text": "Flugbegleiter Peter Jilke lebt in Greifenstein bei Limburg und arbeitet seit 1993 bei Lufthansa. Er ist Langstreckenpurser und fliegt besonders häufig in die USA.",
      "size": "MEDIUM",
      "variant": "BODY",
      "id": "/lh/de/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-chicago_paragraph_29"
     }
    ],
